Well, you haven't mentioned your level and what monsters you are
sacrificing, so we can't really tell if you're altar-camping enough or
not.

But you did mention you are dragging corpses back to the altar... how
far away was that? Corpses rot, and if they are not fresh, you will
get a nothing happened message when you sacrifice - that means your
sacrifice was rejected (though no harm done).

If that's what was happening to you, then it's no wonder why you can't
get gifts... because you were not offering enough fresh corpses!

To camp efficiently, you need to stay near the altar, and have some
ways to generate monsters - wands, scrolls and spell of create monster
and pudding farming.



